flowchart TB
    subgraph Cloud[Production AWS account]
        subgraph Control[ARM64 EC2 control plane]
            K3s[K3s server]
            Ingress[Traefik ingress]
            API[Backend API]
            Redis[Redis]
            Dashboard[Private dashboard]
        end
        DB[(PostgreSQL on EBS)]
        S3[S3 site, archives, and job objects]
        CDN[CloudFront]
        ECR[ECR image repositories]
    end

    subgraph Hybrid[On-prem Linux host]
        Worker[Match and ladder workers]
    end

    K3s --> Ingress
    Ingress --> API
    Ingress --> Dashboard
    API --> Redis
    API --> DB
    API --> S3
    Worker --> Redis
    Worker --> DB
    Worker --> S3
    ECR --> K3s
    S3 --> CDN

